{"3500530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Optimize Man: Gymcel", "steam_appid": 3500530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OptimizeMan: Gymcel is an experimental, grotesque, satirical, gym simulation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as OptimizeMan, a regular guy grinding at the Hypermaxx Facility, where the pressure to level up physically and mentally slowly distorts reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Todo List:</strong> Each morning you must pick 3 tasks for your daily todo-list, failing them is at expense to your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workout Minigames:</strong> Try to lift as heavy as you can without rupturing your bicep, or play it cool and go for reps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Simulator:</strong> Pursue friendships with gibberish speaking NPC's who are constantly judging you, or ignore them all and go goblin mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weird Muscle Deformations: </strong> Gain strength and watch your muscles bulge.  Does the receptionist mog you with her pristine chiseled jawline? </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OptimizeMan: Gymcel is an experimental, grotesque, satirical, gym simulation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as OptimizeMan, a regular guy grinding at the Hypermaxx Facility, where the pressure to level up physically and mentally slowly distorts reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Todo List:</strong> Each morning you must pick 3 tasks for your daily todo-list, failing them is at expense to your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workout Mini